    },
    {
      "id": "f_xB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 844,
      "y": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Pushed from the middle to an\nedge and exhausted there.\n→ REOFFER THE EXHAUSTED EDGE,\nrisk against structure at the\nedge, target the other side.\n\"a look of exhaustion or some\nstructural component to lean\non\" DD @35:15",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f_xC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 424,
      "y": 420,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Escaped an edge and is\nBUILDING outside it. This is\nacceptance, not a look.\n→ DO NOT FADE IT. Wait for it to\ncome back inside first.\n\"I am no longer interested in\nshorting anything down here\"\nDD @32:45",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f_xD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 844,
      "y": 420,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Sitting in the middle, no setup,\nnot moving toward an edge.\n→ NOTHING. Wait for the edge.\n\"it's a coin flip -- let it move\"\n\"Nobody wants to be full size in\nthe middle of a balance zone.\"\nDD @35:44",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f_cbox",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 612,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 60,
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f_ctxt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 622,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Top-left and bottom-left both start with price outside the box — the difference is whether it came back in (fade it) or built out there (leave it alone).\n\"if we look outside, come back in, and we're holding in here, nothing in my right mind is telling me to short that.\" DD @32:03",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:05.146Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f_xA2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 424,
      "y": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Looked outside, failed, came\nback in. The outside look is the\nrejection; the re-entry is the\nconfirmation.\n→ FADE THE FAILED LOOK.\nTarget the far edge.\n\"the above look is a fail\"\nDD @34:40",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:27.974Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:24:27.974Z",
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
